Input Structure
n                        -> number of slots
slotId size              -> each slot
q                        -> number of queries

Commands:
    PARK vehicleNumber type size
    UNPARK ticketId

Sample Input
    3
    S1 SMALL
    S2 MEDIUM
    S3 LARGE
    5
    PARK DL01 BIKE SMALL
    PARK DL02 CAR MEDIUM
    UNPARK T1
    PARK DL03 TRUCK LARGE
    UNPARK T2


Sample Output (approx)
    PARKED T123 S1
    PARKED T456 S2
    PAID T123 2
    UNPARKED T123
    PARKED T789 S3
    PAID T456 5
    UNPARKED T456